{"1688640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isle Goblin", "steam_appid": 1688640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans have come for your Island, and they’re not leaving quietly. Tasked with turning this war-torn land back into a home, you and your Goblin brethren must use every tool at your disposal to fight back and rebuild what was once yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to revert the Island to its former glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your tools, gather your Goblins, and show the humans who really owns this dirt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean Up on Isle Goblin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted world of Goblin whimsy across varied biomes, sprawling cave systems, and blasphemous human temples. Venture beyond the safety of your goblin swamp or delve deep underground to fight, mine and gather the resources you need to survive. Level up and gear up to take on the powerful human bosses standing between you and the rest of your displaced goblin family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild your Goblin Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, upgrade and restore your village from the ground up to defend against the encroaching humans. Build homes, shops and taverns and fill them with the most entertainingly weird neighbours imaginable - each with their own personality, daily schedule and something to offer you in return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Salvage Human ‘Treasure’</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One man’s trash is another goblin’s treasure. Scavenge discarded human junk throughout the world into gear, gizmos and upgrades that can be used to fight back against their very creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress to Distress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skin tone, hairstyles, features, outfits, accessories - no two goblins look the same. Tweak your appearance until you have the face only a fellow goblin could love: taste is completely optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8-Player Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischief is always best enjoyed with good goblin company. Team up with 7 friends to become a proper dysfunctional tribe. More hands for building, more pickaxes for mining, and more bodies to throw at humans when things inevitably go sideways.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans have come for your Island, and they’re not leaving quietly. Tasked with turning this war-torn land back into a home, you and your Goblin brethren must use every tool at your disposal to fight back and rebuild what was once yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to revert the Island to its former glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your tools, gather your Goblins, and show the humans who really owns this dirt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean Up on Isle Goblin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.mp4?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted world of Goblin whimsy across varied biomes, sprawling cave systems, and blasphemous human temples. Venture beyond the safety of your goblin swamp or delve deep underground to fight, mine and gather the resources you need to survive. Level up and gear up to take on the powerful human bosses standing between you and the rest of your displaced goblin family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild your Goblin Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.poster.avif?t=1787588282\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.webm?t=1787588282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com